WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.317 --> 00:00:04.984
- Good morning Believe Nation, it's Evan.

00:00:04.984 --> 00:00:07.208
My one word is believe and I believe that

00:00:07.208 --> 00:00:10.426
you have a special ability
to create something amazing

00:00:10.426 --> 00:00:12.352
that can change the planet.

00:00:12.352 --> 00:00:13.824
So to help you on your
journey today we're going to

00:00:13.824 --> 00:00:17.626
talk about how to deal
with difficult people.

00:00:17.626 --> 00:00:20.209
(gentle music)

00:00:34.748 --> 00:00:37.719
- Your ability to deal
with people is going to

00:00:37.719 --> 00:00:40.315
have more of an influence on
your success and happiness

00:00:40.315 --> 00:00:43.037
than any other skill you can develop.

00:00:43.037 --> 00:00:45.970
Now it's easy to deal
with pleasant positive

00:00:45.970 --> 00:00:47.146
cheerful people.

00:00:47.146 --> 00:00:50.142
It's when you have to
deal with difficult people

00:00:50.142 --> 00:00:52.723
that you really demonstrate
the quality of your

00:00:52.723 --> 00:00:56.808
personality and your
ability to function well

00:00:56.808 --> 00:00:59.128
in a competitive society.

00:00:59.128 --> 00:01:01.061
So how do you deal with difficult people?

00:01:01.061 --> 00:01:04.156
People who have problems,
people who are angry,

00:01:04.156 --> 00:01:07.313
people who are frustrated,
people who attack you.

00:01:07.313 --> 00:01:10.757
Worst of all, people who
do not mean you any good

00:01:10.757 --> 00:01:13.444
and want to take advantage of you.

00:01:13.444 --> 00:01:16.027
(gentle music)

00:01:17.273 --> 00:01:22.147
- Keep your perspective as
being a champion of humanity.

00:01:22.147 --> 00:01:23.572
What do I mean by that?

00:01:23.572 --> 00:01:25.218
You know what happens often times

00:01:25.218 --> 00:01:27.171
when we're frustrated with other people is

00:01:27.171 --> 00:01:28.880
we've lost our connection with humanity

00:01:28.880 --> 00:01:29.738
in some way or another.

00:01:29.738 --> 00:01:31.267
We're in a big hurry

00:01:31.267 --> 00:01:33.785
and we've forgotten
that people have stories

00:01:33.785 --> 00:01:36.003
and realities that we do not know about.

00:01:36.003 --> 00:01:39.350
You don't know what is
going on in somebody's day

00:01:39.350 --> 00:01:41.447
when they've just pissed you off, right?

00:01:41.447 --> 00:01:43.483
They just did something and
you think, oh well you know

00:01:43.483 --> 00:01:45.330
they're like this, or,
they were going like this.

00:01:45.330 --> 00:01:46.571
You don't know.

00:01:46.571 --> 00:01:48.505
Maybe you had a co-worker
who was supposed to

00:01:48.505 --> 00:01:50.215
deliver something in the
morning, and they didn't deliver.

00:01:50.215 --> 00:01:52.235
Now you're fired up and
you're frustrated about them.

00:01:52.235 --> 00:01:53.068
But, you didn't know that
oh their child woke up

00:01:53.068 --> 00:01:57.315
in the morning, and was
throwing up a whole morning

00:01:57.315 --> 00:02:01.811
and and they haven't slept
in the last nine hours.

00:02:01.811 --> 00:02:04.134
Sometimes you don't know that somebody

00:02:04.134 --> 00:02:05.678
had a death in the family.

00:02:05.678 --> 00:02:08.235
Sometimes you don't know
somebody on their way to work

00:02:08.235 --> 00:02:10.043
got some terrible news.

00:02:10.043 --> 00:02:12.919
Sometimes you don't
know the real challenge

00:02:12.919 --> 00:02:16.160
and frustrations people are
dealing with at their home,

00:02:16.160 --> 00:02:19.938
at their in their regular
life with their family.

00:02:19.938 --> 00:02:21.731
You don't know.

00:02:21.731 --> 00:02:23.574
You don't know if this person
who you're so angry with

00:02:23.574 --> 00:02:25.317
you'd feel like, gah,

00:02:25.317 --> 00:02:26.178
I just wish I could punch them in the face

00:02:26.178 --> 00:02:27.011
I'm so mad at them.

00:02:27.011 --> 00:02:28.132
You don't know that they're a victim

00:02:28.132 --> 00:02:29.690
of a domestic violence at a home.

00:02:29.690 --> 00:02:31.710
See, we make all these
assumptions about people,

00:02:31.710 --> 00:02:33.495
well they're just so
stupid or there's something

00:02:33.495 --> 00:02:34.707
wrong with them.

00:02:34.707 --> 00:02:37.460
And we never know their real story.

00:02:37.460 --> 00:02:39.713
And soon as you lose
your patience with people

00:02:39.713 --> 00:02:42.840
you lose your connection with humanity.

00:02:42.840 --> 00:02:45.426
You lose that understanding
that you know what,

00:02:45.426 --> 00:02:47.154
stuff happens in people's lives.

00:02:47.154 --> 00:02:49.305
And maybe right now
they've had a lot of chaos

00:02:49.305 --> 00:02:51.080
and your life is going along smooth.

00:02:51.080 --> 00:02:52.859
Or maybe you're having a lot
of chaos and all of a sudden

00:02:52.859 --> 00:02:56.493
your chaos and your smoothness
or whatever, it interacts.

00:02:56.493 --> 00:02:58.307
And if you feel like it's going to explode

00:02:58.307 --> 00:03:00.259
in this great amount of frustration.

00:03:00.259 --> 00:03:02.629
And you forget well oh gosh,

00:03:02.629 --> 00:03:03.754
people have things going on.

00:03:03.754 --> 00:03:07.441
As busy, as stress-filled as you are

00:03:07.441 --> 00:03:09.517
other people have that too.

00:03:09.517 --> 00:03:10.559
As freaked out,

00:03:10.559 --> 00:03:12.602
as a heavy plate of
responsibilities as you have

00:03:12.602 --> 00:03:13.743
other people have that too.

00:03:13.743 --> 00:03:16.551
And if you don't believe
that, then you've gotten

00:03:16.551 --> 00:03:20.244
to a place where you've
allowed your intellect to grow

00:03:20.244 --> 00:03:21.846
your ego to such a level

00:03:21.846 --> 00:03:24.249
that you can't connect
with humanity anymore.

00:03:24.249 --> 00:03:25.952
And I know that sounds flippant to say,

00:03:25.952 --> 00:03:28.657
but what happens for so many people is,

00:03:28.657 --> 00:03:29.733
they do there.

00:03:29.733 --> 00:03:32.011
Especially folks who are quote
unquote intellectuals right

00:03:32.011 --> 00:03:34.023
people who feel like they're very evolved,

00:03:34.023 --> 00:03:36.106
enlightened, supremely conscious.

00:03:36.106 --> 00:03:37.952
What ends up happening
for them is sometimes

00:03:37.952 --> 00:03:40.817
they have lost that real
connection with humanity

00:03:40.817 --> 00:03:43.448
because they think they're so
special versus other people.

00:03:43.448 --> 00:03:45.797
And here's the ultimately
the challenge with folks

00:03:45.797 --> 00:03:47.375
who do have an ego like that

00:03:47.375 --> 00:03:49.560
or who do feel so much
more supremely special

00:03:49.560 --> 00:03:51.797
than other people that other people

00:03:51.797 --> 00:03:54.125
they just don't understand
how much the frustrating me.

00:03:54.125 --> 00:03:56.415
They become very caged in their life.

00:03:56.415 --> 00:03:59.642
It's like watching an animal that is caged

00:03:59.642 --> 00:04:01.695
that gets resigned because it's been

00:04:01.695 --> 00:04:03.526
wild and free at some point and now it's

00:04:03.526 --> 00:04:05.106
resigned in the back of the cage,

00:04:05.106 --> 00:04:07.622
curled up angry and
frustrated pointing at people.

00:04:07.622 --> 00:04:10.041
They don't understand me,
they don't understand me,

00:04:10.041 --> 00:04:11.846
they don't understand me.

00:04:11.846 --> 00:04:13.894
And the folks who often say,

00:04:13.894 --> 00:04:15.832
other people don't understand me,

00:04:15.832 --> 00:04:18.412
are the same people who rarely ever

00:04:18.412 --> 00:04:21.285
raise their hand and ask for help.

00:04:21.285 --> 00:04:24.029
They're the folks who
easily get frustrated,

00:04:24.029 --> 00:04:27.036
annoyed or resign from other people.

00:04:27.036 --> 00:04:29.431
And now, when they need help,

00:04:29.431 --> 00:04:30.983
or when they want to progress their life

00:04:30.983 --> 00:04:32.712
because they've drawn away from people

00:04:32.712 --> 00:04:34.582
who they believe to be stupid,

00:04:34.582 --> 00:04:36.080
because they've drawn away from others

00:04:36.080 --> 00:04:38.081
who they believe other
people can't understand them.

00:04:38.081 --> 00:04:39.522
Because they believe other people can't

00:04:39.522 --> 00:04:41.708
understand them, they don't ask for help.

00:04:41.708 --> 00:04:45.124
They don't collaborate,
they don't socialize.

00:04:45.124 --> 00:04:48.112
They don't create the very
influenced relationships

00:04:48.112 --> 00:04:51.065
and networks that is necessary for them

00:04:51.065 --> 00:04:53.872
to grow to the next level in their life

00:04:53.872 --> 00:04:55.385
and in their business.

00:04:55.385 --> 00:04:58.277
So you have to think
about that for a moment.

00:04:58.277 --> 00:04:59.961
Have you got so disconnected
from other people

00:04:59.961 --> 00:05:02.539
that you're often frustrated with them

00:05:02.539 --> 00:05:05.510
because you forgot that you
don't understand their story.

00:05:05.510 --> 00:05:07.385
You don't know what they're going through.

00:05:07.385 --> 00:05:09.797
Just like you're frustrated
and you're saying,

00:05:09.797 --> 00:05:11.359
well they don't know
what I'm going through.

00:05:11.359 --> 00:05:13.802
Everybody else feels that way.

00:05:13.802 --> 00:05:16.045
Once you understand
that really the reality

00:05:16.045 --> 00:05:19.370
of humanity is it's a bunch
of human beings walking around

00:05:19.370 --> 00:05:21.299
with a sign at the top
of their head that says,

00:05:21.299 --> 00:05:23.721
please understand me,

00:05:23.721 --> 00:05:25.578
please be patient with me,

00:05:25.578 --> 00:05:26.578
please help,

00:05:27.717 --> 00:05:30.065
then you stop getting so
frustrated with people.

00:05:30.065 --> 00:05:32.282
And you realize that we're all struggling,

00:05:32.282 --> 00:05:33.793
we're all doing the best that we can.

00:05:33.793 --> 00:05:36.234
We all have big dreams
and goals and desires

00:05:36.234 --> 00:05:38.477
and being connected to
humanity is learning

00:05:38.477 --> 00:05:40.345
to be patient with people to get.

00:05:40.345 --> 00:05:42.345
- Number two, stay calm.

00:05:44.023 --> 00:05:45.856
How we feel internally

00:05:46.767 --> 00:05:49.850
is how we carry ourselves externally.

00:05:51.696 --> 00:05:53.196
Once you can smile

00:05:54.642 --> 00:05:56.432
when you're dealing with people

00:05:56.432 --> 00:05:59.024
that you don't resonate
with, difficult people.

00:05:59.024 --> 00:06:03.609
Once you can keep calm that
inner balance is essential.

00:06:03.609 --> 00:06:04.865
Keep your head up.

00:06:04.865 --> 00:06:08.281
A lot of people walk
around their whole life

00:06:08.281 --> 00:06:10.637
with their head down to the ground.

00:06:10.637 --> 00:06:12.914
Keep your back straight.

00:06:12.914 --> 00:06:14.855
Stand your ground.

00:06:14.855 --> 00:06:17.801
You don't have to become
confrontational with anybody

00:06:17.801 --> 00:06:21.134
but we all must tap into our inner power

00:06:22.198 --> 00:06:24.638
because the power is within.

00:06:24.638 --> 00:06:28.388
We have to really be
connected to who we are.

00:06:30.198 --> 00:06:31.281
Breathe easy.

00:06:32.902 --> 00:06:36.069
Once you can be calm and not become so

00:06:36.981 --> 00:06:39.064
reactive, a lot of people

00:06:41.001 --> 00:06:42.416
that annoy us

00:06:42.416 --> 00:06:45.248
they want us to fall into their trap.

00:06:45.248 --> 00:06:47.072
Difficult people, whether it's at work

00:06:47.072 --> 00:06:48.655
wherever it may be,

00:06:50.479 --> 00:06:52.325
they want you to battle with them.

00:06:52.325 --> 00:06:56.215
Whatever you fight you give energy to.

00:06:56.215 --> 00:06:59.173
Therefore resistance makes stronger.

00:06:59.173 --> 00:07:01.423
Once you can become silent,

00:07:02.361 --> 00:07:05.549
say what you want to say but
become silent within yourself

00:07:05.549 --> 00:07:08.814
you develop inner peace and balance.

00:07:08.814 --> 00:07:12.364
And therefore that difficult
person is no longer difficult.

00:07:12.364 --> 00:07:14.870
There are no difficult people

00:07:14.870 --> 00:07:18.037
is how we interpret what is difficult.

00:07:19.680 --> 00:07:23.847
It is our interpretation of
what it means to be difficult.

00:07:26.418 --> 00:07:30.392
It's different for every
single person on the planet.

00:07:30.392 --> 00:07:33.025
- Take a deep breath, and be patient.

00:07:33.025 --> 00:07:34.961
Calm down, go slow.

00:07:34.961 --> 00:07:37.885
Don't let other people's
negativity or anger

00:07:37.885 --> 00:07:39.775
or frustration affect you.

00:07:39.775 --> 00:07:43.942
Step back in your own mind
mentally and just smile.

00:07:45.191 --> 00:07:47.590
You know there's an old
saying, if you don't

00:07:47.590 --> 00:07:50.225
if you can't say something
nice, don't talk at all

00:07:50.225 --> 00:07:51.377
is my advice.

00:07:51.377 --> 00:07:53.546
Sometimes the very best thing you can do

00:07:53.546 --> 00:07:58.343
in dealing with difficult people
is just to be dead silent.

00:07:58.343 --> 00:08:01.920
Don't feed the fire by
arguing or getting involved.

00:08:01.920 --> 00:08:03.493
When you're dealing
with a difficult person

00:08:03.493 --> 00:08:05.621
just stop the clock like a timeout,

00:08:05.621 --> 00:08:08.293
just smile and don't say anything.

00:08:08.293 --> 00:08:10.443
And then when you do say something

00:08:10.443 --> 00:08:14.226
remember one of the great
communication tools is this,

00:08:14.226 --> 00:08:18.021
is the person who asks
questions has control.

00:08:18.021 --> 00:08:20.629
The way that you can take control of any

00:08:20.629 --> 00:08:23.966
negative situation is not trying to win

00:08:23.966 --> 00:08:26.887
but simply by asking questions.

00:08:26.887 --> 00:08:30.322
Say, you know what why do you say that?

00:08:30.322 --> 00:08:32.562
Or, why do you feel that way?

00:08:32.562 --> 00:08:34.890
Or, that's an interesting point of view.

00:08:34.890 --> 00:08:38.147
How did you come to that point of view?

00:08:38.147 --> 00:08:41.933
Or, how would we know
that what you say is true?

00:08:41.933 --> 00:08:44.992
I mean, is there any proof or validity?

00:08:44.992 --> 00:08:48.630
Instead of attacking simply ask questions.

00:08:48.630 --> 00:08:51.893
And it's sort of like the
matador backs away from the bull

00:08:51.893 --> 00:08:54.207
is you keep backing away from the bull

00:08:54.207 --> 00:08:57.941
you cape the difficult person
by simply asking questions

00:08:57.941 --> 00:09:00.140
and being genuinely curious

00:09:00.140 --> 00:09:03.301
about what he or she
is thinking and feeling

00:09:03.301 --> 00:09:06.699
and why they are behaving
the way they are.

00:09:06.699 --> 00:09:09.012
Sometimes you may find that
they have a good reason.

00:09:09.012 --> 00:09:12.533
Sometimes you may find that
they misunderstand something.

00:09:12.533 --> 00:09:14.130
Maybe you will find that they

00:09:14.130 --> 00:09:16.414
have a difficult problem in their lives.

00:09:16.414 --> 00:09:20.142
But in any case, be calm, be patient,

00:09:20.142 --> 00:09:22.991
be controlled and ask questions

00:09:22.991 --> 00:09:26.152
and it will make you the
master of the situation.

00:09:26.152 --> 00:09:29.566
- Some people have got
a negative blood group.

00:09:29.566 --> 00:09:31.426
It's just the way some people are.

00:09:31.426 --> 00:09:33.957
They wear negativity like
an old comfortable coat,

00:09:33.957 --> 00:09:36.848
it just seems to fit them really well.

00:09:36.848 --> 00:09:38.233
So they're the kind of people that

00:09:38.233 --> 00:09:41.043
even if they won the lottery would say,

00:09:41.043 --> 00:09:44.253
she'll smile. look it
wasn't the rollover week.

00:09:44.253 --> 00:09:48.666
In their mantra for life, never
forget every silver lining

00:09:48.666 --> 00:09:50.857
has a black cloud.

00:09:50.857 --> 00:09:52.904
But I want us to be
careful of these people

00:09:52.904 --> 00:09:56.668
because sometimes I think
we need to challenge them

00:09:56.668 --> 00:09:58.390
because sometimes I think they're unaware

00:09:58.390 --> 00:10:00.562
of how their negativity and their misery

00:10:00.562 --> 00:10:02.925
can impact those around them.

00:10:02.925 --> 00:10:07.092
Maybe you could even use
humor to defuse the situation.

00:10:08.430 --> 00:10:11.058
How long have you been a
motivational speaker then?

00:10:11.058 --> 00:10:13.293
But I think we need to
be careful that although

00:10:13.293 --> 00:10:15.726
people might be miserable by nature,

00:10:15.726 --> 00:10:18.649
let's just be prepared to challenge that

00:10:18.649 --> 00:10:21.444
and sometimes use humor
to defuse the situation.

00:10:21.444 --> 00:10:24.515
- My philosophy on this is really simple

00:10:24.515 --> 00:10:27.794
is the philosophy that life is too short

00:10:27.794 --> 00:10:30.532
for dealing with difficult
and toxic people.

00:10:30.532 --> 00:10:34.329
I mean like why, why make life
more difficult for yourself,

00:10:34.329 --> 00:10:37.112
life is already pretty challenging.

00:10:37.112 --> 00:10:39.174
You're already working
really hard on your own life,

00:10:39.174 --> 00:10:42.558
on your own self, why are
you bringing yourself down

00:10:42.558 --> 00:10:44.983
with these, with these toxic people?

00:10:44.983 --> 00:10:47.795
There's like, there's
no reason for it, right?

00:10:47.795 --> 00:10:51.616
So my strategy here and
my solution ultimately

00:10:51.616 --> 00:10:54.679
is to get rid of these
people out of my life.

00:10:54.679 --> 00:10:56.282
I want to live a life where the people

00:10:56.282 --> 00:10:58.357
that are in my life are supporting me,

00:10:58.357 --> 00:11:01.355
encouraging me, bringing in positivity.

00:11:01.355 --> 00:11:03.947
They're building they're building

00:11:03.947 --> 00:11:07.993
something with me, rather
than going against me.

00:11:07.993 --> 00:11:10.999
And so that's kind of
the the ultimate solution

00:11:10.999 --> 00:11:14.454
I really want to get to like
the root cause of it here.

00:11:14.454 --> 00:11:16.493
Because a lot of people what they do

00:11:16.493 --> 00:11:18.825
what I see them doing is they're so stuck

00:11:18.825 --> 00:11:20.826
like in the social matrix.

00:11:20.826 --> 00:11:23.645
They're so worried about
being relied relying

00:11:23.645 --> 00:11:26.284
upon various social relationships,

00:11:26.284 --> 00:11:29.163
that they're not willing to get rid of

00:11:29.163 --> 00:11:30.990
these toxic people out of their lives.

00:11:30.990 --> 00:11:32.870
And what this does is
it just it creates this

00:11:32.870 --> 00:11:34.799
like spiral of negativity that goes down

00:11:34.799 --> 00:11:37.235
and down and down and
it brings you with it.

00:11:37.235 --> 00:11:39.243
And there's no need to
live a life like that.

00:11:39.243 --> 00:11:40.712
In fact, what I'm going to argue is

00:11:40.712 --> 00:11:42.562
that you can't really self-actualize,

00:11:42.562 --> 00:11:45.774
you can't really create a
powerful and happy fulfilling life

00:11:45.774 --> 00:11:48.821
if you're surrounding yourself
with these types of folks.

00:11:48.821 --> 00:11:50.817
Jim Rohn, I love Jim Rohn,

00:11:50.817 --> 00:11:52.528
has a lot of great wisdom.

00:11:52.528 --> 00:11:55.017
One of the most wise
things that he said was

00:11:55.017 --> 00:11:58.992
that you are the average
of the top five associates

00:11:58.992 --> 00:12:00.909
that you hang out with.

00:12:02.227 --> 00:12:04.748
What this means is that if
you take and make a list

00:12:04.748 --> 00:12:08.164
of all the people in your life
and you write a number down

00:12:08.164 --> 00:12:09.897
for how many hours per week

00:12:09.897 --> 00:12:12.723
you're spending with with
each one of those people.

00:12:12.723 --> 00:12:14.981
And you then rank everybody according

00:12:14.981 --> 00:12:17.322
to the number of hours
you spend with them,

00:12:17.322 --> 00:12:21.150
the top five people that you
spend the most time with,

00:12:21.150 --> 00:12:24.900
these are the people that have
the most influence on you.

00:12:24.900 --> 00:12:26.818
It's a very simple theory,

00:12:26.818 --> 00:12:28.923
basically whoever you hang out with

00:12:28.923 --> 00:12:31.355
is who you are going to
absorb into yourself.

00:12:31.355 --> 00:12:34.366
And you kind of become
the average of all that.

00:12:34.366 --> 00:12:37.027
Well if this principle is true

00:12:37.027 --> 00:12:39.758
then who do you want to
surround yourself with?

00:12:39.758 --> 00:12:41.840
Positive empowering people?

00:12:41.840 --> 00:12:44.673
Or, negative disempowering people?

00:12:45.866 --> 00:12:47.516
If you do this exercise,
you actually write this out

00:12:47.516 --> 00:12:50.599
and you actually tally up the numbers

00:12:51.813 --> 00:12:53.525
you might be shocked to discover

00:12:53.525 --> 00:12:55.827
that you hang out with some
people a lot more than others.

00:12:55.827 --> 00:12:57.667
You might also be shocked to discover

00:12:57.667 --> 00:12:58.993
that some of those people
that you hang out with

00:12:58.993 --> 00:13:03.160
and spend five or ten or
even 20 hours a week with

00:13:04.074 --> 00:13:06.116
that those are super negative super

00:13:06.116 --> 00:13:09.366
pessimistic super miserable and depressive

00:13:09.366 --> 00:13:11.596
anger prone type of people.

00:13:11.596 --> 00:13:14.705
And maybe that's why you're
not getting the success

00:13:14.705 --> 00:13:16.863
you want in your life is because

00:13:16.863 --> 00:13:21.170
you're around these type
of people all the time.

00:13:21.170 --> 00:13:22.595
