00:13:22.595 --> 00:13:24.463
I'd love to know what did
you think of this video,

00:13:24.463 --> 00:13:27.202
what was the rule that most applies to you

00:13:27.202 --> 00:13:29.070
that you're going to immediately implement

00:13:29.070 --> 00:13:31.762
somehow into your life or your business?

00:13:31.762 --> 00:13:33.365
Please let me know, I'd
love to hear from you,

00:13:33.365 --> 00:13:34.711
leave it down in the comments below.

